  "description": "Build and use combinational logic gates at the circuit and component level: transistor-level inverters and NAND/NOR from discrete BJTs, diode-transistor logic, the 74xx TTL and 4000 CMOS logic families, logic-level parameters, open-collector/open-drain buses, and tri-state buffers.",
